sequenceDiagram
  participant V as Visitor
  participant L as BlogListing
  participant A as BlogArticle
  participant E as AnalyticsEmitter
  participant GA as GA4
  participant F as Formspree

  V->>L: Click tag "Tech"
  L->>E: emit blog_tag_filter {tag:"Tech", result_count:4}
  E-->>GA: POST measurement payload
  V->>L: Click article card "Solar Charging for E-bikes"
  L->>A: Navigate to article page
  A->>E: emit blog_article_read {slug:"solar-charging", read_percent:25}
  V->>A: Scroll to subscription banner
  A->>F: POST hashed email via IC-7
  A->>E: emit blog_subscription_banner {action:"submit", consent_granted:true}
  F-->>A: 200 OK
